        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-17T22:01:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack, as per discussed offline, changed to a synchronized block. I\u0027m still of the opinion that r/w locks are more readable, since they convey the intent of what happens within them, but that could be just me.",
      "parentUuid": "a11f26be_7221d7e1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 291,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 293,
        "endChar": 44
